# Rendered by paisans. Do not edit: `paisans apply` overwrites this file.
#
# Object storage, served to browsers and to federating servers. What crosses
# this hostname differs by app, and the blanket claim this comment used to make
# was false for one of them.
#
# Mbin writes to Garage itself, server side, over the mesh, so its uploads do
# not come this way and only the URL it publishes is served here.
#
# Outline's server never writes bytes to S3 at all. It issues a presigned POST
# that the browser submits directly against this hostname, so for Outline every
# upload crosses this gateway as well as every read. That is why the `Host`
# header below is forwarded unchanged rather than merely left alone.
#
# NEVER GATE THIS HOSTNAME. A federating server fetching an image is a machine,
# and it will not follow a redirect to a passkey prompt.
#
# Host is forwarded unchanged, and that is load bearing rather than tidy.
# Outline presigns URLs, the signature covers the host it was signed with, and
# rewriting this header to the upstream address invalidates every signature it
# issues. Garage treats a host it does not recognise as a vhost as a path style
# request, which is why path style addressing stays on for every app.
reverse_proxy 10.44.0.1:3900
